      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Planned, not running",
      "items": [
        "The repository currently configures Ollama/OpenAI; Claude, Titan and Bedrock Guardrails require new LiteLLM routes and app guardrail calls.",
        "Select a Claude model or inference profile available in the target Region and verify strict JSON schema output.",
        "Use task IAM roles and scoped Bedrock Runtime VPC endpoints; no static AWS access key in the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deployable service split",
      "items": [
        "Run UI, API, LiteLLM and Phoenix on ECS Fargate behind an authenticated HTTPS entry.",
        "Use separate application RDS pgvector and Phoenix PostgreSQL databases; store policy source files and reports in versioned S3.",
        "Stage S3 files into a one-off ingestion task; the current CLI reads a local path, not s3://."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Operational result",
      "items": [
        "Phoenix receives API and gateway traces; Ragas annotations appear on the evaluated answer span.",
        "Bedrock Guardrails enforce configured input and output policies; the application still checks PII, schema, citations and abstention.",
        "Re-ingest all policies when switching Qwen embeddings to Titan; equal vector lengths do not make embedding spaces compatible."
      ]
    },
